   "title": "N. Korea external works on enrichment facility extension complete: IAEA",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/northkorea/20261118/n-korea-external-works-on-enrichment-facility-extension-complete-iaea",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
