   "title": "Lee heads to China for APEC after wrapping up ASEAN summit",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/world/20261118/lee-heads-to-china-for-apec-after-wrapping-up-asean-summit",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
