   "title": "Lee, Xi hold 3rd summit on APEC sidelines",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/20261118/lee-xi-hold-3rd-summit-on-apec-sidelines",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
