   "summary": "Militants gather at Liwasang Bonifacio in Manila on November 15, 2026, to protest the proposed Pax Silica initiative and US President Donald Trump’s visit to the 49th ASEAN Summit. MANILA, Philippines – US President Donald Trump ’s arrival in Manila on Tuesday, November 17, is expected to draw protests, with activists preparing to march against the US-led Pax Silica.",
   "summary_zh": "2026年11月15日，武武装分子聚集在马尼拉的Liwasang Bonifacio，抗议拟议中的Pax Silica倡议以及美国总统唐纳德·特朗普出席第49届东盟峰会。马尼拉消息——美国总统唐纳德·特朗普预计于11月17日星期二抵达马尼拉，届时可能引发抗议，活动人士正准备游行反对美国主导的Pax Silica。",
