   "title": "Kano govt, Kwankwasiyya Movement clash over attack on Kwankwaso’s convoy",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/kano-govt-kwankwasiyya-movement-clash-over-attack-on-kwankwasos-convoy/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
   "source": "vanguardngr.com",
   "published": "Tue, 17 Nov 2026 05:25:04 +0000",
